  entries:
  - language: 0
    title: Genstart Knap
    description: "\t"
  - language: 1
    title: Reset Button
    description: "The reset button will try and restart the terminal its on. \n\nWhenever
      an terminal gets an error, it will need manual reset to let the terminal try
      and see if the error is gone. If the error is still there, it won't do anything.
      \n\nIf the error is gone, it will then notify the terminal that it's good to
      go. "
